(corpus-ch4-026)
*trajectory 1 source start on 6
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 6 source state
    *when time>1 stop
*trajectory 2 Obj2 start on 1

  *initial from trajectory 1, segment 6

  *segment 1 deployment
    *reset wt=50
    *increment velibx=5
    *increment dxb=0.5 dyb=3.2 dzb=0.35
    *fly pitchi=*
    *fly yawi=*
    *fly rolli=*
    *when tseg>0 goto 2
  *segment 2 synthetic target
    *when time>1 stop
*end
